      "message": "This still can change though, if someone does `setprop log.looper.slow.verbose false` and `setprop log.looper.slow.verbose true` explicitly?\n\nAn easy way to achieve it is to read it in the class initializaer into a static field, but that wouldn\u0027t work because of zygote preload.\n\nTo prevent zygote preloading, you can use an inner class with a special name:\n\n```\n    private static class NoImagePreloadHolder {\n        final boolean sVerboseLogging \u003d\n                SystemProperties.getBoolean(\"log.looper.slow.verbose\", false);\n    }\n``\n\nIf you use it, `sVerboseLogging` would be set when it\u0027s accessed first time, and subsequent reads will return the same value.",
